# Controls what `gcloud builds submit` uploads as the build context.
#
# WITHOUT this file gcloud falls back to .gitignore, whose `*.csv` rule
# silently excluded dbt/seeds/dataset_versions.csv from every build -- the
# containerised dbt build then failed to resolve the seed. Keep this explicit.
.git/
.venv/
data/
docs/
notebooks/
terraform/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
/*.csv
dbt/target/
dbt/dbt_packages/
dbt/logs/
